// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Pack identity
//   Category : mobile native — navigation / checkpoint alerts
//   Pack     : industry-mobile-android (M3 Expressive) + iOS
//   Tone     : serious-precise — real-world safety data
//   Density  : platform-native (48dp tap targets, 64dp nav bar)
//   Accent   : fixed brand blue — Material You dynamic color
//              intentionally OFF; wallpaper-derived hues would
//              conflict with status semantics (red=active,
//              green=clear, amber=police alert).
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

